From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:56:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] KitKat UI P33: KitKat launcher icon for Glimpse (P33.2)

Art from the CandyOS reference set (reference/icons/Gallery.png - the 4.4 Gallery icon). Part of P33: every built-in app drawer icon goes KitKat. The adaptive icon machinery (mipmap-anydpi/ic_launcher.xml plus the ic_launcher_background/foreground/monochrome drawables) is replaced by legacy full-bleed PNGs in every density bucket - the 4.4 launcher-icon behavior. Regenerated by scripts/candyos-gen-icons.py; sources live in the CandyOS repo under reference/.

Change-Id: I6629e281e2940dfb623a21c65568af2a0e20400d
